{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That\u2019s My Tofu</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>VR cooking game</strong> where you gather around a bubbling hotpot, cook delicious ingredients, and race to serve them before your mischievous cousin snatches them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is just a taste of the chaos we\u2019re cooking up in <strong>That\u2019s My Tofu<i>.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three playable levels</strong> featuring the core hotpot cooking gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bonus <strong>Survival Mode</strong> where you\u00a0cook and defend your food for as long as you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingredients included:</strong> meat, shrimp, bok choy, enoki mushrooms, and tofu (of course!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI cousin opponent</strong> who tries to steal your food while you play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089270/extras/c9760f43e7112bea637cc44026f3f424.poster.avif?t=1760498079\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089270/extras/c9760f43e7112bea637cc44026f3f424.webm?t=1760498079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089270/extras/c9760f43e7112bea637cc44026f3f424.mp4?t=1760498079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll get to experience the core of our VR hotpot madness: cooking, serving, and fending off your pesky AI cousin who just can\u2019t keep their chopsticks to themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We\u2019re still in development, and your feedback means the world to us. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reaction, laugh, and suggestion helps us make the full game even better (and maybe a little spicier). So grab your headset, dive in, and let us know what you think: we promise this is only the appetizer. Connect with the development team on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089270?t=1760498079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4089270?t=1760498079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089270/ee64b51d4a2b3b706bff3937fbf22f4d9aabe5d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760498079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089270/ee64b51d4a2b3b706bff3937fbf22f4d9aabe5d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760498079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That\u2019s My Tofu</strong> is a fast-paced <strong>VR cooking game</strong> where you gather around a bubbling hotpot, cook delicious ingredients, and race to serve them before your mischievous cousin snatches them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is just a taste of the chaos we\u2019re cooking up in <strong>That\u2019s My Tofu<i>.</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three playable levels</strong> featuring the core hotpot cooking gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bonus <strong>Survival Mode</strong> where you\u00a0cook and defend your food for as long as you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingredients included:</strong> meat, shrimp, bok choy, enoki mushrooms, and tofu (of course!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI cousin opponent</strong> who tries to steal your food while you play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089270/extras/c9760f43e7112bea637cc44026f3f424.poster.avif?t=1760498079\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089270/extras/c9760f43e7112bea637cc44026f3f424.webm?t=1760498079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089270/extras/c9760f43e7112bea637cc44026f3f424.mp4?t=1760498079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll get to experience the core of our VR hotpot madness: cooking, serving, and fending off your pesky AI cousin who just can\u2019t keep their chopsticks to themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We\u2019re still in development, and your feedback means the world to us. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every reaction, laugh, and suggestion helps us make the full game even better (and maybe a little spicier). So grab your headset, dive in, and let us know what you think: we promise this is only the appetizer. Connect with the development team on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p>","developers":["Christine Kneer","Elena Xinyue Peng","Jacqueline Guan"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3977020","name":"That's My Tofu"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.a